{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はみんなで収録でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかったよ！！！たくさん笑ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼に食べたチキン南蛮のお弁当おいしかったし、楽屋に突然凍天が現れて\n伊織にあっためてもらって食べた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サクサクでジューシーで\nもちもちでおいしかったあああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんごさんが凍天のお店ひらいたら\n毎日通おうっと。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/20/7532765/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/20/7532765/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/20/7532765/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16枚目の個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月は今年最後の握手、\n1月は来年最初の握手になるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーゆうのちょっと特別です\nどきどき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月4日の握手会では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな祭りの次の日ということで\n日奈子とひなをかけて\n何かひなまつりっぽい\n特別な感じにしようかな(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":